Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtmultimedia, python3-mutagen
Recommends: libnotify-bin, ffmpeg
Homepage: https://linuxtuts.online/vaevictis/vaevictis.html
Description: Aurora, the VaeVictis music player
 A simple music player written in Python with Qt 6: library and playlists,
 search, shuffle and repeat, playback speed and a real-time spectrum that
 follows the music. It makes no network connection at all.
 .
 Part of VaeVictis OS.
